Not congratulating you.

3226
02:15:24,690 --> 02:15:26,720
Area C goes to...

3227
02:15:26,720 --> 02:15:28,660
- Choi Hye Seon.
- Yes!

3228
02:15:28,660 --> 02:15:30,560
Area D goes to...

3229
02:15:30,590 --> 02:15:31,900
Kang Ji Hoo.

3230
02:15:32,260 --> 02:15:36,070
- You took 1-3-3, right?
- Yes.

3231
02:15:36,200 --> 02:15:38,770
Shin Seung Yong, please place your cards.

3232
02:15:39,370 --> 02:15:40,440
What shall we do?

3233
02:15:40,800 --> 02:15:42,170
Wouldn't it be the best...

3234
02:15:42,210 --> 02:15:43,810
- if you use 1 and 3 on me?
- Oh, okay.

3235
02:15:45,010 --> 02:15:46,610
(Kang Ji Hoo)

3236
02:15:46,610 --> 02:15:49,950
(He places 3 and 1 in Ji Hoo's slots.)

3237
02:15:49,950 --> 02:15:52,180
(He places the rest in YunB's slot.)

3238
02:15:54,380 --> 02:15:55,550
Three and one?

3239
02:15:58,260 --> 02:16:02,530
(Kang Ji Hoo, Hong Jin Ho)

3240
02:16:04,830 --> 02:16:06,300
Are you going to catch me?

3241
02:16:09,800 --> 02:16:10,900
- Seong Beom.
- Yes?

3242
02:16:10,900 --> 02:16:12,540
- I think you got caught by Ji Hoo.
- What?

3243
02:16:13,900 --> 02:16:15,010
Hold on.

3244
02:16:15,640 --> 02:16:17,510
- I think you're right.
- Right?

3245
02:16:18,240 --> 02:16:19,610
If he goes one space forward...

3246
02:16:19,610 --> 02:16:20,880
and goes here, it'll be over.

3247
02:16:22,280 --> 02:16:24,210
One space forward...

3248
02:16:24,210 --> 02:16:26,720
One, two. You're right.

3249
02:16:32,860 --> 02:16:34,760
My strategy worked,

3250
02:16:34,860 --> 02:16:36,390
so I felt really proud.

3251
02:16:51,540 --> 02:16:53,310
If you give me 1 and 3,

3252
02:16:53,440 --> 02:16:54,950
I can catch Jin Ho.

3253
02:16:55,210 --> 02:16:57,580
That'd be the best option,
so I think we should take...

3254
02:16:57,580 --> 02:16:59,520
at least one area with 1 and 3.

3255
02:16:59,820 --> 02:17:00,920
I should?

3256
02:17:01,220 --> 02:17:02,390
It doesn't matter.

3257
02:17:02,450 --> 02:17:04,290
One of us will do.
It'll be best if you win it.

3258
02:17:04,850 --> 02:17:07,790
Then I'll bet five...

3259
02:17:08,690 --> 02:17:10,890
- on Area B first.
- Okay.

3260
02:17:10,960 --> 02:17:13,660
Think of how you can win
Area C and Area D,

3261
02:17:13,660 --> 02:17:15,330
- then place your bet.
- Okay.

3262
02:17:15,330 --> 02:17:18,700
They'll end with Seong Beom
in the next round.

3263
02:17:18,740 --> 02:17:22,070
So, Hye Seon and Jin Ho's turns are over.

3264
02:17:22,810 --> 02:17:24,740
They're done with their turns.

3265
02:17:25,580 --> 02:17:27,410
So we're at an advantage.

3266
02:17:27,640 --> 02:17:29,250
What I'm worried about is this.

3267
02:17:29,510 --> 02:17:33,020
We shouldn't use all the good cards
we have here.

3268
02:17:33,420 --> 02:17:34,550
I'll use mine, and you two...

3269
02:17:34,550 --> 02:17:36,650
- should save 4 and 5.
- Yes.

3270
02:17:36,720 --> 02:17:38,490
- I can give them to you.
- Right.

3271
02:17:38,490 --> 02:17:40,290
- You can use yours on me next.
- Okay.

3272
02:17:40,290 --> 02:17:41,290
(They discussed their strategy,
considering next round's turns.)

3273
02:17:42,230 --> 02:17:43,230
Here you are.

3274
02:17:43,230 --> 02:17:46,260
Shin Seung Yong.
You've placed Card Five in Area B.

3275
02:17:46,260 --> 02:17:47,300
(Shin Seung Yong placed 5 in Area B.)

3276
02:17:47,300 --> 02:17:50,070
Kang Ji Hoo.
You've placed Card Two in Area D.

3277
02:17:50,070 --> 02:17:52,970
It was lucky for us
to win the areas we bet on.

3278
02:17:53,140 --> 02:17:56,040
So, we could devise our strategy
for this round.

3279
02:17:57,410 --> 02:17:59,140
I couldn't think of me getting caught.

3280
02:18:03,010 --> 02:18:05,850
The situation wasn't great for us.

3281
02:18:05,850 --> 02:18:09,820
I thought, "How should we play
to overcome this?"

3282
02:18:09,850 --> 02:18:13,020
I kept thinking about that.

3283
02:18:13,690 --> 02:18:16,130
Kang Ji Hoo, please place your cards.

3284
02:18:17,830 --> 02:18:19,260
I can give them reverse and three.

3285
02:18:19,460 --> 02:18:20,600
But who...

3286
02:18:20,900 --> 02:18:21,970
Hold on.

3287
02:18:27,400 --> 02:18:28,540
No.

3288
02:18:29,170 --> 02:18:30,470
Should I give three to Sung Joo?

3289
02:18:30,710 --> 02:18:32,610
- Or...
- Should I give three to Sung Joo...

3290
02:18:33,140 --> 02:18:34,580
and reverse to Jin Ho?

3291
02:18:34,910 --> 02:18:35,950
Not bad.

3292
02:18:37,110 --> 02:18:39,680
(Hyung Sung Joo, Shin Seung Yong)

3293
02:18:39,680 --> 02:18:42,420
(Hong Jin Ho, reverse)

3294
02:18:42,790 --> 02:18:45,060
Hong Jin Ho, please place your cards.

3295
02:18:45,090 --> 02:18:46,120
It's my turn already?

3296
02:18:46,120 --> 02:18:47,890
(Jin Ho's cards of Area A: 2, 2, 1)

3297
02:18:47,990 --> 02:18:49,730
You have reverse.
You have to get rid of it.

3298
02:18:49,730 --> 02:18:51,290
Of course I will.

3299
02:18:51,290 --> 02:18:52,700
I'm thinking of where to place the rest.

3300
02:18:52,830 --> 02:18:54,300
Seung Yong is out there,

3301
02:18:54,360 --> 02:18:55,670
and he's over there.

3302
02:18:56,170 --> 02:18:58,570
If they didn't catch me...

3303
02:19:00,840 --> 02:19:01,870
Let's move Hye Seon.

3304
02:19:01,870 --> 02:19:03,070
Did I get too excited?

3305
02:19:03,610 --> 02:19:04,810
Okay.

3306
02:19:04,810 --> 02:19:06,780
- We could do that.
- That could work. Okay.

3307
02:19:07,810 --> 02:19:08,980
Okay.

3308
02:19:11,410 --> 02:19:12,620
I will...

3309
02:19:12,820 --> 02:19:14,080
remove that.

3310
02:19:14,150 --> 02:19:15,590
- This is Seong Beom.
- Two?

3311
02:19:15,590 --> 02:19:16,650
Okay.

3312
02:19:17,220 --> 02:19:18,390
(Choi Hye Seon)

3313
02:19:18,390 --> 02:19:19,520
Okay.

3314
02:19:21,620 --> 02:19:23,890
Choi Hye Seon, please place your cards.

3315
02:19:23,890 --> 02:19:25,600
(Hye Seon's cards of Area C: 4, 0, 2)

3316
02:19:28,160 --> 02:19:30,770
(Heo Seong Beom, Shin Seung Yong)

3317
02:19:30,800 --> 02:19:33,400
(Remaining Movement Card, 2)

3318
02:19:33,400 --> 02:19:34,470
Should I discard it?

3319
02:19:35,710 --> 02:19:37,240
- Let's discard it.
- Let's discard it.

3320
02:19:37,340 --> 02:19:38,610
Discard it if it's useless.

3321
02:19:38,810 --> 02:19:41,950
- Hye Seon has discarded a card.
- I couldn't think of that.

3322
02:19:43,510 --> 02:19:46,080
All the movement cards have been placed.

3323
02:19:46,950 --> 02:19:49,420
The race cars will start moving now.

3324
02:19:49,420 --> 02:19:51,890
(Everyone's cars except for
Keun Woo and YunB's cars can move.)

3325
02:19:52,060 --> 02:19:54,790
Seung Yong, one space forward.

3326
02:19:54,790 --> 02:19:56,090
(Keun Woo, Ji Hoo: 3 and 1,
YunB: 3 and R, Seong Beom: 4 and 0)

3327
02:19:56,090 --> 02:19:57,360
(Jin Ho: 1 and Reverse, Hye Seon: 2 and 2,
Sung Joo: 3 and 4, Seung Yong)

3328
02:19:57,460 --> 02:19:59,730
Taking the inside line is a lot faster.

3329
02:20:00,500 --> 02:20:02,470
Taking the inside line is important.

3330
02:20:02,670 --> 02:20:06,840
Ji Hoo, 1 space forward and 2 spaces left.

3331
02:20:06,970 --> 02:20:08,470
(Ji Hoo's car
goes on top of Jin Ho's car.)

3332
02:20:08,570 --> 02:20:09,570
You're too heavy.

3333
02:20:10,610 --> 02:20:12,810
- Get off me.
- Gosh.

3334
02:20:14,080 --> 02:20:16,010
You've collided with Jin Ho's race car.

3335
02:20:16,010 --> 02:20:17,480
Why come all the way here?

3336
02:20:18,010 --> 02:20:20,750
Seong Beom, four spaces left.

3337
02:20:20,750 --> 02:20:22,550
(Keun Woo, Ji Hoo: 3 and 1,
YunB: 3 and R, Seong Beom)

3338
02:20:22,550 --> 02:20:24,350
(Jin Ho: 1 and Reverse, Hye Seon: 2 and 2,
Sung Joo: 3 and 4, Seung Yong)

3339
02:20:24,550 --> 02:20:26,790
Jin Ho, you cannot move.

3340
02:20:26,790 --> 02:20:27,790
Okay.

3341
02:20:28,290 --> 02:20:30,560
(He can't move as Ji Hoo's car
is on top of his.)

3342
02:20:30,760 --> 02:20:33,360
Hye Seon, two spaces forward.

3343
02:20:33,500 --> 02:20:34,500
Yes!

3344
02:20:35,430 --> 02:20:36,870
Please move Sung Joo's car quickly.

3345
02:20:37,670 --> 02:20:39,370
- He gets to move after three hours.
- Is he finally moving?

3346
02:20:39,570 --> 02:20:41,540
I thought his tires went out.

3347
02:20:41,540 --> 02:20:42,940
The insanely slow starter.

3348
02:20:42,940 --> 02:20:46,610
Sung Joo, 3 spaces forward
and 1 space right.

3349
02:20:46,610 --> 02:20:47,840
So his car does have tires.

3350
02:20:48,880 --> 02:20:50,680
(Round 16 Movement Results)

3351
02:20:50,680 --> 02:20:52,650
All players have completed their moves.

3352
02:20:52,650 --> 02:20:54,450
(Round 16 Movement Results)

3353
02:20:54,920 --> 02:20:57,290
Round 17 will begin now.

3354
02:20:57,790 --> 02:21:00,720
The movement cards
for each area are revealed.

3355
02:21:02,030 --> 02:21:06,330
(Keun Woo)

3356
02:21:06,860 --> 02:21:08,600
The numbers 4, 0, and 2 keep popping up.

3357
02:21:14,740 --> 02:21:17,370
Most of the players
will be focused on their team's...

3358
02:21:17,670 --> 02:21:21,580
or alliance's movement.

3359
02:21:22,010 --> 02:21:23,310
I would've been out of their interest.

3360
02:21:23,310 --> 02:21:24,410
I was satisfied with that.

3361
02:21:24,680 --> 02:21:25,950
And overall,

3362
02:21:26,980 --> 02:21:30,150
if I started the game with around
a win rate of 20 to 30 percent,

3363
02:21:30,550 --> 02:21:34,390
I believe I'm at 30 to 40 percent now.

3364
02:21:34,390 --> 02:21:35,890
I liked being at the back,

3365
02:21:35,890 --> 02:21:37,330
but I couldn't place last.

3366
02:21:38,030 --> 02:21:40,600
So I did feel a bit anxious.

3367
02:21:40,600 --> 02:21:42,370
I have to stop acting...

3368
02:21:42,370 --> 02:21:43,970
and start pacing forward.

3369
02:21:53,010 --> 02:21:56,380
Sung Joo, place your card
in the area of your choice.

3370
02:22:00,380 --> 02:22:02,550
A drastic number isn't good for me.

3371
02:22:03,820 --> 02:22:06,860
I wanted a number
that could move me gently...

3372
02:22:06,860 --> 02:22:08,930
by 1 space left or 1 space forward.

3373
02:22:11,490 --> 02:22:15,030
Sung Joo,
you've placed Card Two in Area A.

3374
02:22:15,400 --> 02:22:16,400
Right.

3375
02:22:16,670 --> 02:22:18,400
All players have placed their bets.

3376
02:22:18,940 --> 02:22:21,240
I will announce the betting results.

3377
02:22:21,800 --> 02:22:25,440
Area A goes to Sung Joo.

3378
02:22:25,440 --> 02:22:26,440
Gosh.

3379
02:22:26,940 --> 02:22:29,180
Area B goes to Hye Seon.

3380
02:22:29,610 --> 02:22:31,550
Area C goes to YunB.

3381
02:22:32,050 --> 02:22:34,880
Area D has no winners.

3382
02:22:35,850 --> 02:22:38,350
You will now place your movement cards.

3383
02:22:38,820 --> 02:22:40,960
YunB, please place your cards.

3384
02:22:40,960 --> 02:22:42,760
(YunB's cards of Area C: 1, Reverse, 3)

3385
02:22:43,190 --> 02:22:45,190
Seong Beom will reverse three spaces.

3386
02:22:45,630 --> 02:22:46,630
After that,

3387
02:22:47,400 --> 02:22:49,830
you should use one...

3388
02:22:50,370 --> 02:22:51,500
or give it to me.

3389
02:22:52,700 --> 02:22:53,700
It's one or the other.

3390
02:22:53,970 --> 02:22:57,140
(Round 17, YunB, Hye Seon, Sung Joo)

3391
02:22:57,140 --> 02:22:58,780
(Jin Ho: 3, Reverse)

3392
02:22:58,780 --> 02:23:01,040
- I'll take one.
- Okay.

3393
02:23:01,840 --> 02:23:04,810
(YunB: 3, 1)

3394
02:23:04,810 --> 02:23:08,250
I think we can accurately predict
2nd and 3rd place.

3395
02:23:08,250 --> 02:23:09,420
- We can do that.
- Right.

3396
02:23:11,320 --> 02:23:13,520
Hye Seon, please place your cards.

3397
02:23:13,520 --> 02:23:15,990
(Hye Seon's cards of Area B: 4, 0, 2)

3398
02:23:16,560 --> 02:23:19,700
- Answer me with a voice filled with rage.
- Right.

3399
02:23:19,700 --> 02:23:21,400
Should we flip Ji Hoo's car over for now?

3400
02:23:22,670 --> 02:23:23,670
That's a good idea.

3401
02:23:23,670 --> 02:23:25,340
Right. That's the only move possible.

3402
02:23:25,340 --> 02:23:26,940
That's a good idea.

3403
02:23:27,070 --> 02:23:28,770
What should we do? Is that better?

3404
02:23:28,770 --> 02:23:30,240
- That's...
- That's the best move, right?

3405
02:23:30,240 --> 02:23:31,640
Right. That's the best move.

3406
02:23:33,480 --> 02:23:35,240
Let's flip Ji Hoo's car.

3407
02:23:35,240 --> 02:23:36,850
Let's flip it over.

3408
02:23:38,210 --> 02:23:40,120
Should I place it on yours?
One space to the right?

3409
02:23:40,120 --> 02:23:43,020
- My car? YunB will go there.
- Doesn't that work?

3410
02:23:43,750 --> 02:23:44,950
Move it to the left.

3411
02:23:44,950 --> 02:23:46,490
- The left of your car?
- Right.

3412
02:23:46,520 --> 02:23:49,060
(Hong Jin Ho: 2)

3413
02:23:49,460 --> 02:23:52,060
Sung Joo, please place your cards.

3414
02:23:52,060 --> 02:23:53,760
(Sung Joo's cards of Area A: 2, 3, 1)

3415
02:23:55,200 --> 02:23:59,500
(He places the cards on his gear board.)

3416
02:24:00,100 --> 02:24:04,610
(The movement card left is 3.)

3417
02:24:05,540 --> 02:24:06,540
Will you give that to us?

3418
02:24:07,110 --> 02:24:09,210
If you're torn, place it next to two.
Let's destroy it all.

3419
02:24:12,620 --> 02:24:13,850
Destroy it all!

3420
02:24:13,850 --> 02:24:16,290
Sung Joo has discarded a card.

3421
02:24:17,120 --> 02:24:19,560
All the movement cards have been placed.

3422
02:24:20,460 --> 02:24:22,930
The race cars will start moving now.

3423
02:24:22,930 --> 02:24:23,930
(Ji Hoo, YunB, Seong Beom,
and Sung Joo's cars can move.)

3424
02:24:24,590 --> 02:24:27,530
Ji Hoo, four spaces right.

3425
02:24:28,970 --> 02:24:30,670
You've collided with the wall.

3426
02:24:30,670 --> 02:24:34,200
Your race car has flipped over,
and you cannot move until the next round.

3427
02:24:34,200 --> 02:24:35,340
Okay.

3428
02:24:36,110 --> 02:24:39,880
YunB, 1 space forward and 2 spaces left.

3429
02:24:41,740 --> 02:24:44,010
Seong Beom, three spaces backward.

3430
02:24:44,010 --> 02:24:45,180
No!

3431
02:24:45,680 --> 02:24:49,650
(Seong Beom: 3, Reverse)

3432
02:24:49,650 --> 02:24:51,650
You've placed last for the first time
in your life, right?

3433
02:24:53,260 --> 02:24:54,260
Yes.

3434
02:24:55,020 --> 02:24:56,990
- What a jerk.
- Think that you're first from behind.

3435
02:24:56,990 --> 02:24:58,060
I'm first from behind.

3436
02:24:58,760 --> 02:25:02,630
Sung Joo, 1 space forward
and 1 space left.

3437
02:25:03,070 --> 02:25:04,130
Let's go past halfway.

3438
02:25:04,830 --> 02:25:05,970
(Round 17 Movement Results)

3439
02:25:05,970 --> 02:25:07,500
(Player, predicted rank)

3440
02:25:07,500 --> 02:25:09,470
All players have completed their moves.

3441
02:25:09,470 --> 02:25:10,510
(Hye Seon 3, YunB 3, Ji Hoo 2, Jin Ho 1,)

3442
02:25:10,510 --> 02:25:11,570
(Seung Yong 7, Sung Joo 7,
Keun Woo 7, Seong Beom 6)

3443
02:25:11,710 --> 02:25:13,910
Round 18 will begin now.

3444
02:25:14,710 --> 02:25:17,550
The movement cards
for each area are revealed.

3445
02:25:18,280 --> 02:25:22,450
(Ji Hoo)

3446
02:25:22,820 --> 02:25:26,590
(Keun Woo only goes forward.)

3447
02:25:26,990 --> 02:25:30,630
Keun Woo, place your card
in the area of your choice.

3448
02:25:31,660 --> 02:25:32,960
Keun Woo,

3449
02:25:33,460 --> 02:25:35,770
you've placed your card in Area B.
Is that right?

3450
02:25:35,770 --> 02:25:36,830
Yes.

3451
02:25:37,700 --> 02:25:40,500
Seong Beom had to move forward.

3452
02:25:40,800 --> 02:25:44,010
I had to move in slightly to the inside...

3453
02:25:44,010 --> 02:25:45,240
to raise the chance
of me placing seventh...

3454
02:25:45,240 --> 02:25:47,680
even though it may end up as a tie.

3455
02:25:47,680 --> 02:25:50,180
For me to take the inside line,

3456
02:25:50,180 --> 02:25:52,780
I had to get that area no matter what.

3457
02:25:53,020 --> 02:25:54,020
This time,

3458
02:25:55,150 --> 02:25:58,190
it will be good for you to take Area A.

3459
02:25:58,190 --> 02:25:59,660
Because I go first?

3460
02:25:59,890 --> 02:26:04,330
(Ji Hoo's remaining cards)

3461
02:26:04,330 --> 02:26:07,660
Ji Hoo, you've placed Card Five in Area A.

3462
02:26:07,660 --> 02:26:08,900
There was a reason why I played five.

3463
02:26:09,270 --> 02:26:12,240
I saved 5 and 4
as they were the best cards.

3464
02:26:12,240 --> 02:26:16,040
I thought that many other players would
play their fives after saving them up.

3465
02:26:16,040 --> 02:26:17,440
Playing 5 now and saving 4...

3466
02:26:17,440 --> 02:26:19,910
for the last round
seemed like a better play.

3467
02:26:19,910 --> 02:26:21,540
That was why I did that.

3468
02:26:24,510 --> 02:26:28,280
The most important rounds for us
are the last round...

3469
02:26:28,280 --> 02:26:30,550
and Round 19.

3470
02:26:30,550 --> 02:26:33,390
Rounds 17 and 18 are also important,

3471
02:26:33,390 --> 02:26:34,860
but keeping my position...

3472
02:26:34,860 --> 02:26:37,490
wasn't a bad option.

3473
02:26:38,690 --> 02:26:41,730
Seung Yong,
you've placed Card Two in Area B.

3474
02:26:41,860 --> 02:26:46,240
YunB, you've placed Card One in Area D.

3475
02:26:46,240 --> 02:26:47,300
- Is that right?
- Yes.

3476
02:26:48,300 --> 02:26:51,670
It's the best for us to get Area C.
If we do that,

3477
02:26:52,180 --> 02:26:57,150
Seong Beom can go to Sung Joo
with 3 or 4 and stop him.

3478
02:26:57,150 --> 02:26:58,210
Right.

3479
02:26:58,210 --> 02:27:00,150
- Let's do that.
- Right.

3480
02:27:01,180 --> 02:27:02,650
The game is slowly reaching the end.

3481
02:27:05,390 --> 02:27:06,490
Hye Seon,

3482
02:27:06,490 --> 02:27:07,490
(Hye Seon's remaining cards)

3483
02:27:07,490 --> 02:27:10,060
place your card
in the area of your choice.

3484
02:27:10,060 --> 02:27:11,130
Okay.

3485
02:27:12,730 --> 02:27:16,000
Hye Seon,
you've placed Card Three in Area A.

3486
02:27:16,000 --> 02:27:19,140
Seong Beom,
you've placed Card Two in Area C.

3487
02:27:19,140 --> 02:27:20,400
(Jin Ho's remaining cards)

3488
02:27:20,400 --> 02:27:21,540
(Team P3 Alliance placed 2 card
in Area C.)

3489
02:27:21,540 --> 02:27:25,170
Jin Ho, you've placed Card Five in Area C.

3490
02:27:25,980 --> 02:27:27,680
All players have placed their bets.

3491
02:27:27,940 --> 02:27:29,350
Will we win it this time?

3492
02:27:30,880 --> 02:27:32,850
I will announce the betting results.

3493
02:27:33,150 --> 02:27:34,150
Area A.

3494
02:27:34,150 --> 02:27:35,150
(Ji Hoo and Hye Seon
made a bet for Area A.)

3495
02:27:35,150 --> 02:27:37,520
(Sung Joo's remaining cards)

3496
02:27:37,520 --> 02:27:41,060
Sung Joo, place your card
in the area of your choice.

3497
02:27:41,060 --> 02:27:44,460
(Sung Joo's remaining cards)

3498
02:27:44,460 --> 02:27:48,500
Sung Joo,
you've placed Card Three in Area.

3499
02:27:48,830 --> 02:27:52,340
Area A goes to Ji Hoo.

3500
02:27:52,340 --> 02:27:53,900
(Area A goes to Ji Hoo.)

3501
02:27:54,100 --> 02:27:58,010
Area B goes to Keun Woo.

3502
02:27:58,010 --> 02:27:59,880
(Area B goes to Keun Woo.)

3503
02:28:00,340 --> 02:28:03,750
- Area C goes to Jin Ho.
- Right.

3504
02:28:04,080 --> 02:28:07,750
Area D goes to YunB.

3505
02:28:07,750 --> 02:28:09,290
(Area D goes to YunB.)

3506
02:28:09,550 --> 02:28:10,820
- We got it by fluke.
- What?

3507
02:28:10,820 --> 02:28:12,120
We got it by fluke.

3508
02:28:12,520 --> 02:28:15,160
You will now place your movement cards.

3509
02:28:15,390 --> 02:28:17,630
Ji Hoo, please place your cards.

3510
02:28:19,030 --> 02:28:21,400
I checked to see who I should pull back.

3511
02:28:22,370 --> 02:28:24,500
Jin Ho kept pacing forward.

3512
02:28:26,140 --> 02:28:28,970
I thought that he was betting for
1st, 2nd, or 3rd.

3513
02:28:30,010 --> 02:28:31,070
"I can't stand and watch."

3514
02:28:32,540 --> 02:28:34,740
(Ji Hoo places reverse on Jin Ho.)

3515
02:28:34,910 --> 02:28:36,150
Where must I place the other two?

3516
02:28:37,880 --> 02:28:38,980
What do you have?

3517
02:28:39,520 --> 02:28:41,220
We can play up to five...

3518
02:28:41,220 --> 02:28:42,850
- since our turns are next to each other.
- Right.

3519
02:28:43,220 --> 02:28:44,790
I think we can discard them.

3520
02:28:46,260 --> 02:28:48,020
- Discard them?
- Let's not discard them.

3521
02:28:48,220 --> 02:28:51,130
I'll give Seung Yong 1
and place 1 on mine.

3522
02:28:51,930 --> 02:28:53,400
If two is placed,

3523
02:28:53,400 --> 02:28:54,900
my car won't crash.

3524
02:28:55,230 --> 02:28:56,470
That will happen...

3525
02:28:56,470 --> 02:28:59,100
- if I place two.
- Right.

3526
02:28:59,700 --> 02:29:00,800
- Right?
- Yes.

3527
02:29:00,970 --> 02:29:02,170
(YunB places 2 on the left
of his gear board.)

3528
02:29:02,470 --> 02:29:04,910
YunB, please place your card.

3529
02:29:06,140 --> 02:29:07,780
(He places 3 on the right
of his gear board.)

3530
02:29:08,610 --> 02:29:11,180
I'll place one on Keun Woo's board.

3531
02:29:11,750 --> 02:29:13,750
But if you do that,

3532
02:29:13,750 --> 02:29:15,690
aren't we helping them...

3533
02:29:15,690 --> 02:29:17,450
by letting them use it
whenever they want to?

3534
02:29:17,450 --> 02:29:19,660
- How about we discard both of them?
- All right.

3535
02:29:22,120 --> 02:29:24,160
YunB has discarded the cards.

3536
02:29:24,990 --> 02:29:27,160
Jin Ho, please place your cards.

3537
02:29:27,160 --> 02:29:28,330
Right.

3538
02:29:28,860 --> 02:29:29,870
After that,

3539
02:29:30,530 --> 02:29:33,170
let's see. I'll give one to you, Hye Seon.

3540
02:29:33,170 --> 02:29:34,570
- I think it'll be better to do that.
- Right.

3541
02:29:34,570 --> 02:29:36,040
- Place one on hers.
- Right.

3542
02:29:36,040 --> 02:29:37,610
- Place it on hers.
- It's best to be at the front.

3543
02:29:37,610 --> 02:29:39,480
- It's the left, right?
- Yes.

3544
02:29:39,480 --> 02:29:40,980
Double check.

3545
02:29:40,980 --> 02:29:42,080
(He places 2 on Hye Seon's left.)

3546
02:29:42,080 --> 02:29:44,350
Keun Woo, please place your cards.

3547
02:29:45,580 --> 02:29:46,720
His straightforwardness.

3548
02:29:47,420 --> 02:29:48,420
Am I right?

3549
02:29:49,450 --> 02:29:50,450
I'm right.

3550
02:29:50,450 --> 02:29:51,550
(Keun Woo places 3 and 0
on his gear board as planned.)

3551
02:29:51,550 --> 02:29:53,260
What place did you bet for?

3552
02:29:54,560 --> 02:29:56,390
You wanted to go back so much earlier.

3553
02:29:56,560 --> 02:29:58,230
Keun Woo is...

3554
02:29:58,590 --> 02:29:59,830
He's controlling the game.

3555
02:29:59,830 --> 02:30:01,100
(The controller of this game, Keun Woo)

3556
02:30:01,100 --> 02:30:02,900
All right. Go, Seung Yong.

3557
02:30:02,900 --> 02:30:05,130
All the movement cards have been placed.

3558
02:30:05,130 --> 02:30:07,500
The race cars will start moving now.

3559
02:30:07,500 --> 02:30:08,570
(Keung Woo: 3, 0, Ji Hoo: Unknown,
YunB: 2, 3, Seong Beom: 3, 4,)

3560
02:30:08,570 --> 02:30:09,640
(Jin Ho: 2, Reverse, Hye Seon: 2, R,
Sung Joo, Seung Yong: 1, 1)

3561
02:30:09,840 --> 02:30:13,540
YunB, 2 spaces forward and 1 space right.

3562
02:30:14,410 --> 02:30:16,280
What? Did things get turned around?

3563
02:30:16,710 --> 02:30:20,720
Seong Beom, 3 spaces forward
and 1 space right.

3564
02:30:21,420 --> 02:30:23,320
You've collided with Sung Joo's race car.

3565
02:30:23,320 --> 02:30:24,790
(Seong Beom's car went on top
of Sung Joo's car.)

3566
02:30:25,050 --> 02:30:27,660
Jin Ho, two spaces backward.

3567
02:30:27,660 --> 02:30:29,830
(Jin Ho, moves two spaces backward.)

3568
02:30:31,560 --> 02:30:33,660
"It's a really tough game
to take first place."

3569
02:30:33,660 --> 02:30:35,060
"Did I come up with the wrong plan?"

3570
02:30:35,060 --> 02:30:38,000
It was a moment
that made me feel those things.

3571
02:30:38,130 --> 02:30:40,740
Seung Yong, one space forward.

3572
02:30:40,740 --> 02:30:42,200
(Seung Yong, moves one space forward.)

3573
02:30:42,200 --> 02:30:44,840
Keun Woo, three spaces left.

3574
02:30:44,840 --> 02:30:45,940
(Keun Woo, moves three spaces left.)

3575
02:30:45,940 --> 02:30:48,440
I got it done. I entered a safe course.

3576
02:30:48,440 --> 02:30:50,850
"There's no one who can stop me."

3577
02:30:50,850 --> 02:30:55,250
Why is that?
The ones who picked the top places,

3578
02:30:55,250 --> 02:30:58,390
won't be looking at me.
They have to look forward.

3579
02:30:58,390 --> 02:31:00,260
All the movement cards have been placed.

3580
02:31:00,260 --> 02:31:01,820
(All the movement cards have been placed
for Round 18.)

3581
02:31:01,820 --> 02:31:03,030
(Round 18 Movement Results)

3582
02:31:03,030 --> 02:31:04,790
(Player, predicted rank)

3583
02:31:04,790 --> 02:31:05,800
(YunB 3, Hye Seon 3, Ji Hoo 2,)

3584
02:31:05,800 --> 02:31:06,800
(Seung Yong unknown, Jin Ho 1, Keun Woo 7,
Seong Beom 6, Sung Joo unknown)

3585
02:31:06,830 --> 02:31:09,060
Round 19 will begin now.

3586
02:31:11,130 --> 02:31:13,870
The movement cards
for each area are revealed.

3587
02:31:13,870 --> 02:31:15,400
(YunB)

3588
02:31:16,410 --> 02:31:17,770
I must do well here.

3589
02:31:19,710 --> 02:31:23,150
This is fun. It's hard to predict
how things will go until the end.

3590
02:31:23,780 --> 02:31:25,920
There are two rounds left.

3591
02:31:26,280 --> 02:31:28,020
There are three in our team,

3592
02:31:28,320 --> 02:31:30,520
and the cards we can get are limited.

3593
02:31:30,650 --> 02:31:33,520
It's going to be about
who we will push for the lead.

3594
02:31:33,660 --> 02:31:35,760
Even if we want to push Jin Ho,

3595
02:31:35,760 --> 02:31:39,400
he's in a position
that isn't that threatening.

3596
02:31:41,630 --> 02:31:43,430
- You're in a dangerous spot.
- Right.

3597
02:31:45,530 --> 02:31:48,640
This was my first time playing this game.

3598
02:31:48,640 --> 02:31:50,540
I wondered what the best way was
to play this game.

3599
02:31:50,540 --> 02:31:53,110
Until the middle of the game,

3600
02:31:53,110 --> 02:31:54,410
we could've all made aggressive plays...

3601
02:31:54,410 --> 02:31:57,410
by attacking, defending,

3602
02:31:57,410 --> 02:31:59,480
and smashing the others.

3603
02:31:59,480 --> 02:32:02,050
That was a bit disappointing
now that I think about it.

3604
02:32:07,020 --> 02:32:08,960
Would you like to join us?
It's the end of the game.

3605
02:32:09,160 --> 02:32:10,360
There are two rounds left.

3606
02:32:12,060 --> 02:32:14,130
- I'll pick my cards first.
- Okay.

3607
02:32:14,130 --> 02:32:18,170
(Keun Woo decides to join Team P3 Alliance
for the remaining rounds.)

3608
02:32:23,810 --> 02:32:25,770
I was in 3rd place in Round 19.

3609
02:32:25,770 --> 02:32:27,840
I was near the wall on the right.

3610
02:32:28,180 --> 02:32:30,180
It was so easy for the Alliance...

3611
02:32:30,180 --> 02:32:31,810
to make my car crash to the right.

3612
02:32:32,010 --> 02:32:35,020
I have no hope
if my car flips over at this point.

3613
02:32:35,020 --> 02:32:36,990
I won't be able to move during Round 20.

3614
02:32:37,120 --> 02:32:39,020
I'll end the game in third place.

3615
02:32:39,020 --> 02:32:40,390
(Keun Woo's remaining cards)

3616
02:32:40,390 --> 02:32:43,290
Keun Woo,
you've placed Card Three in Area D.

3617
02:32:43,290 --> 02:32:45,530
(Keun Woo places Card 3 in Area D.)

3618
02:32:45,860 --> 02:32:47,000
But...

3619
02:32:47,000 --> 02:32:50,870
if they get any card,
they can flip over my car.

3620
02:32:51,470 --> 02:32:55,870
YunB has to get it first to save me.

3621
02:33:02,310 --> 02:33:04,650
- Right now,
- Yes?

3622
02:33:04,650 --> 02:33:06,050
this is my last time I get to go first.

3623
02:33:06,650 --> 02:33:09,450
You're next.

3624
02:33:09,450 --> 02:33:10,520
(YunB is the 1st player in Round 19.)

3625
02:33:10,520 --> 02:33:12,760
Are you guys almost there?

3626
02:33:12,760 --> 02:33:16,060
We're in a pretty good spot.
I can tell you that much.

3627
02:33:17,160 --> 02:33:18,660
What places did you guys bet for?

3628
02:33:18,690 --> 02:33:20,260
- What?
- What places did you guys bet for?

3629
02:33:21,300 --> 02:33:22,460
- Do you want to know?
- Yes.

3630
02:33:22,700 --> 02:33:23,700
I'll pretend not to know.

3631
02:33:28,370 --> 02:33:30,640
All right. Make sure to keep our deal.

3632
02:33:31,140 --> 02:33:32,270
Ji Hoo has to place second.

3633
02:33:32,270 --> 02:33:33,310
(YunB tells Sung Joo the predicted ranks
of his alliance.)

3634
02:33:33,310 --> 02:33:34,340
- Ji Hoo?
- Second.

3635
02:33:34,340 --> 02:33:35,410
- Second? And?
- Yes.

3636
02:33:35,410 --> 02:33:36,880
- I have to place third.
- Right. And?

3637
02:33:38,450 --> 02:33:41,720
Sung Joo and I were both in Team P2.

3638
02:33:42,550 --> 02:33:44,050
He suggested that we form an alliance.

3639
02:33:44,050 --> 02:33:46,420
I was someone he could trust,

3640
02:33:46,460 --> 02:33:48,290
and we had a connection through Team P2.

3641
02:33:48,290 --> 02:33:51,660
When he suggested that
we form an alliance toward the end,

3642
02:33:51,660 --> 02:33:54,560
we checked each other's predicted ranks.

3643
02:33:55,560 --> 02:33:57,800
You two should go outside and talk.

3644
02:33:59,470 --> 02:34:00,840
You two should go outside and talk.

3645
02:34:00,840 --> 02:34:02,610
(YunB makes Sung Joo
and Seung Yong talk with each other.)

3646
02:34:02,770 --> 02:34:03,970
Do you need Area C right now?

3647
02:34:04,170 --> 02:34:05,340
- Me?
- Yes.

3648
02:34:05,340 --> 02:34:07,710
It doesn't matter for us.

3649
02:34:07,980 --> 02:34:09,080
What do you need?

3650
02:34:09,410 --> 02:34:11,210
I think I definitely need Area C.

3651
02:34:11,280 --> 02:34:12,410
- Area C?
- Yes.

3652
02:34:13,380 --> 02:34:14,650
What place do you have to be in?

3653
02:34:14,850 --> 02:34:16,420
- Is it the same rank as mine?
- No.

3654
02:34:16,420 --> 02:34:18,490
- What's your predicted rank?
- It's around that.

3655
02:34:19,050 --> 02:34:20,420
You won't tell me? I told you.

3656
02:34:20,420 --> 02:34:21,460
(Sung Joo double-checks the rank
he heard from YunB.)

3657
02:34:21,460 --> 02:34:22,630
Tell me if we have the same rank.

3658
02:34:22,630 --> 02:34:24,290
It's fine as we don't have the same rank.

3659
02:34:24,630 --> 02:34:27,100
The reason I can't tell you...

3660
02:34:27,100 --> 02:34:28,930
is because it'll be the end of me
once people hear about it.

3661
02:34:29,260 --> 02:34:31,070
I haven't formed an alliance with anyone.

3662
02:34:31,530 --> 02:34:32,870
This is my first time
reaching out to your team.

3663
02:34:32,870 --> 02:34:35,440
I'm worried that the others might ask...

3664
02:34:35,440 --> 02:34:36,610
after we talk together.

3665
02:34:37,170 --> 02:34:39,580
- So you won't tell me?
- Anyway...

3666
02:34:40,010 --> 02:34:42,080
I wasn't able to...

3667
02:34:42,240 --> 02:34:43,780
fully trust Sung Joo.

3668
02:34:44,880 --> 02:34:46,480
- All right.
- Hold on.

3669
02:34:47,050 --> 02:34:48,820
My predicted rank is six.

3670
02:34:49,590 --> 02:34:52,020
It's hard to predict
what the others have under their sleeves.

3671
02:34:52,020 --> 02:34:54,360
There's no one who I can fully trust.

3672
02:34:54,590 --> 02:34:59,130
But in the intense moments
toward the end of the semi-finals,

3673
02:34:59,130 --> 02:35:00,530
I must give my trust.
There's no other choice.

3674
02:35:00,530 --> 02:35:02,930
Things started to flow again...

3675
02:35:02,930 --> 02:35:05,530
like the alliance game we were used to.

3676
02:35:05,600 --> 02:35:06,800
Then...

3677
02:35:06,800 --> 02:35:09,200
(Sung Joo and Seung Yong decide
to share their betting information.)

3678
02:35:09,200 --> 02:35:11,770
I think it'll be better for you
to place five for Area C.

3679
02:35:12,140 --> 02:35:13,410
Or it can be four.

3680
02:35:13,680 --> 02:35:14,840
We're planning to...

3681
02:35:14,840 --> 02:35:17,080
sweep away everything
during the next round.

3682
02:35:18,310 --> 02:35:20,850
Okay. I'll make my bet.

3683
02:35:22,650 --> 02:35:27,590
(It turns out to be a 4-on-4 match
toward the end.)

3684
02:35:27,690 --> 02:35:30,990
Jin Ho, place your card
in the area of your choice.

3685
02:35:31,460 --> 02:35:32,660
I'm broke.

3686
02:35:33,260 --> 02:35:38,430
(Jin Ho's remaining cards)

3687
02:35:38,430 --> 02:35:39,600
(Jin Ho places Card 4 in Area A.)

3688
02:35:39,600 --> 02:35:43,070
Jin Ho, you've placed Card Four in Area A.

3689
02:35:43,070 --> 02:35:44,770
I can't give up until the end.

3690
02:35:44,770 --> 02:35:48,210
I tried to get the best result
after placing my bet.

3691
02:35:48,210 --> 02:35:51,080
I was determined to
attack and defend well.

3692
02:35:51,150 --> 02:35:54,420
Seong Beom,
you've placed Card Five in Area C.

3693
02:35:54,750 --> 02:35:57,690
The other team is still using
the reverse card well.

3694
02:35:58,150 --> 02:36:00,120
I was even more determined...

3695
02:36:00,120 --> 02:36:01,390
to take away...

3696
02:36:01,390 --> 02:36:03,630
the reverse card from them.

3697
02:36:03,860 --> 02:36:05,660
(Hye Seon's remaining cards)

3698
02:36:05,660 --> 02:36:08,960
Hye Seon,
you've placed Card Two in Area B.

3699
02:36:08,960 --> 02:36:10,100
- Is that right?
- Yes.

3700
02:36:10,100 --> 02:36:11,570
(Hye Seon bets a 2 on Area B.)

3701
02:36:16,370 --> 02:36:19,980
Sung Joo, place your card
in the area of your choice.

3702
02:36:21,280 --> 02:36:24,950
(Sung Joo decides to make a bet
on Area C.)

3703
02:36:27,020 --> 02:36:30,320
Sung Joo, you've placed a card in Area C.

3704
02:36:30,320 --> 02:36:31,350
Right.

3705
02:36:31,550 --> 02:36:34,760
Seung Yong,
you've placed Card Three in Area C.

3706
02:36:34,760 --> 02:36:35,990
- Is that right?
- Yes.

3707
02:36:35,990 --> 02:36:37,030
(Seung Yong bets a 3 on Area C.)

3708
02:36:37,390 --> 02:36:40,160
YunB, you've placed a card in Area A.

3709
02:36:40,760 --> 02:36:43,770
Ji Hoo, place your card
in the area of your choice.

3710
02:36:43,770 --> 02:36:46,500
(Ji Hoo's remaining cards)

3711
02:36:47,070 --> 02:36:50,110
Ji Hoo, you've placed Card One in Area B.

3712
02:36:50,410 --> 02:36:52,240
All players have placed their bets.

3713
02:36:53,640 --> 02:36:55,680
I will announce the betting results.

3714
02:36:57,080 --> 02:36:58,150
Area A...

3715
02:36:59,550 --> 02:37:02,280
